{"error": false, "page": 2, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 2, "recordCount": 117, "data": [{"docid2": 2005266, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202403/t20240302_2005266.htm", "content": "\n　　3月1日，市政府召开廉政工作会议，学习贯彻习近平总书记关于党的自我革命的重要思想，贯彻落实国务院、省政府廉政工作会议精神，总结全市政府系统党风廉政建设和反腐败工作，部署下阶段工作任务。市政府党组书记", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202403/t20240302_2005266.htm", "docreltime": "2024.03.02 12:06:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开廉政工作会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2180726, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202403/t20240302_2005266.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202403/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1999869, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/t20240203_1999869.htm", "content": "\n　　2月2日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进财源培植和财政增收节支工作。市领导杨国昕、张元明、廖金辉、钟科参加会议。\n　　李春强调，要着力强根基，锚定高质量发展主线，狠抓特色产业链“延链补链强", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/t20240203_1999869.htm", "docreltime": "2024.02.03 15:34:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2169960, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/t20240203_1999869.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202402/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1998373, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240129_1998373.htm", "content": "\n　　1月26日，三明市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕带队赴泉州考察，参观了晋江经验馆，并就泉明山海协作工作进行座谈交流。泉州市委常委、常务副市长黄景春全程陪同，泉州市委常委、晋江市委书记张文贤陪同考察，三明市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240129_1998373.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.28 10:21:00", "doctitle": "市领导带队赴泉州对接山海协作工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2168277, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240129_1998373.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1997798, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240126_1997798.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕到三明动车站、汽车客运站等地开展春运安全检查工作，并慰问一线工作者。\n　　市领导强调，各级各有关部门要按照全国、全省春运工作电视电话会议以及全市春运工作部署，坚持“", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240126_1997798.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.26 10:12:00", "doctitle": "市领导开展春运安全检查工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2167483, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240126_1997798.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1995817, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240119_1995817.htm", "content": "\n　　1月18日，省委常委、常务副省长郭宁宁赴三明市协调推进沪明对口合作，先后深入华东师大附属三明中学、沪明临港产业园、防汛应急综合指挥平台、爱琴海购物中心等项目调研，并召开沪明革命老区对口合作座谈会，现", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240119_1995817.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.19 09:34:00", "doctitle": "省领导赴三明协调推进革命老区重点城市对口合作工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2165203, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240119_1995817.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1995810, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240119_1995810.htm", "content": "\n　　1月18日，市委书记李兴湖、市长李春会见省消防救援总队总队长高宁宇一行。省消防救援总队副总队长苏作琴，市领导杨国昕、郭海阳参加。\n　　李兴湖对省消防救援总队和全市消防指战员为三明经济社会平稳健康发展作", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240119_1995810.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.19 09:25:00", "doctitle": "市领导会见省消防救援总队总队长高宁宇一行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2165207, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240119_1995810.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1993378, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/sld/ygx/xghdbd_4920/202401/t20240111_1993378.htm", "content": "\n　　市长李春作政府工作报告 （周志鸿 摄）\n　　赖碧涛主持会议\n　　李兴湖 宋志强 詹积富 杨兴忠 黄冠华 陈列平 刘宝怀 吴国顺 王军强 杨国昕 郑隆松 侯典荟 郭海阳等在主席台就座\n　　1月10日上午，三明市第十四届", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2024.01.11 09:00:00", "doctitle": "市十四届人大三次会议开幕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162547, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "allx.jpg", "appdocid": 1993378, "appfile": "W020240111326324788109.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202401/W020240111/W020240111326324788109.jpg", "_href": "W020240111326324788109.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020240111326324788109.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1993435, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240111_1993435.htm", "content": "\n　　1月10日下午，市政协十一届三次会议第二次全体会议在市会议中心召开。会上，委员们进行了大会发言。\n　　大会执行主席宋志强、黄冠华、蒋先东、罗金水、许清华、曾明生、陈欣、张春华、张炜琳、黄月珍、张元江在", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240111_1993435.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.11 08:56:00", "doctitle": "市政协十一届三次会议举行第二次全体会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162555, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240111_1993435.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1993365, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240111_1993365.htm", "content": "\n　　1月10日，市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕在三元区调研烟火江湖、欢乐未来城、爱琴海购物中心等项目建设、运营管理等情况，推动一季度经济社会“开门红”“开门稳”。\n　　市领导强调，各级各有关部门要按照市委、市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240111_1993365.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.11 08:53:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研市区一季度 “开门红”“开门稳”工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162550, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240111_1993365.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1992978, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240110_1992978.htm", "content": "\n　　9日，中国人民政治协商会议第十一届三明市委员会第三次会议在市会议中心开幕。（周志鸿 吴佳霖 摄影报道）\n　　1月9日上午， 中国人民政治协商会议第十一届三明市委员会第三次会议在市会议中心开幕。来自各条战", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240110_1992978.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.10 08:39:00", "doctitle": "市政协十一届三次会议开幕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162558, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240110_1992978.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "9a825ec.jpg", "appdocid": 1992978, "appfile": "W020240110312966377340.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240110_1992978.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202401/W020240110/W020240110312966377340.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/W020240110312966377340.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/W020240110312966377340.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1992653, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/t20240109_1992653.htm", "content": "\n　　1月8日，市长李春主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推动一季度“开门红”工作。市领导王军强、杨国昕、林菁、廖金辉、柳建忠、钟科、郑剑波参加。\n　　李春强调，要深入贯彻中央和省委、市委经济工作会议精神，坚定", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/t20240109_1992653.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.09 08:50:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162149, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/t20240109_1992653.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zyhy/qthy/qthy/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1992308, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240108_1992308.htm", "content": "\n　　1月7日，市委副书记、市长李春会见中国科学院院士、武汉大学遥感信息工程学院教授龚健雅一行。市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕参加。\n　　李春代表市委、市政府对龚健雅一行的到来表示欢迎。她表示，三明市委、市政", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240108_1992308.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.08 08:59:00", "doctitle": "市领导会见中国科学院院士龚健雅一行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162561, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240108_1992308.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1992206, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240106_1992206.htm", "content": "\n　　1月5日，市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕调研大田万达矿业、闽鹭矿业等矿山企业，了解隐患排查整治、应急设施配备、安全生产防范、应急预案演练等情况，并主持召开座谈会，推动全市矿山安全生产治理工作。\n　　会议", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240106_1992206.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.06 10:28:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研矿山安全生产工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2162572, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/t20240106_1992206.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202401/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1990192, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231230_1990192.htm", "content": "\n　　12月29日，在收听收看全省安全防范工作视频会议后，我市紧接着召开会议，迅速贯彻落实全省会议精神，进一步安排部署全市岁末年初安全防范工作。市长李春出席会议并讲话，市委常委、常务副市长杨国昕参加会议。\n", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231230_1990192.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.30 09:31:00", "doctitle": "全市安全防范工作视频会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2159523, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231230_1990192.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1989758, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231229_1989758.htm", "content": "\n　　12月27日，市委书记李兴湖主持召开县（市、区）委书记座谈会。市委副书记、市长李春和市领导杨兴忠、杨国昕、郭海阳、钟科参加。\n　　在听取有关情况汇报后，李兴湖强调，各县（市、区）要认真学习中央和省委经", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231229_1989758.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.29 10:14:00", "doctitle": "县（市、区）委书记座谈会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2159538, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231229_1989758.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1987467, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231224_1987467.htm", "content": "\n　　12月22日，中央生态环保督察通报“福建省一些化工园区环境违法违规问题比较突出”等典型案例后，省委省政府高度重视，省委书记周祖翼、省长赵龙第一时间作出批示。23日，根据省委和省政府安排，副省长林瑞良赴三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231224_1987467.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.24 11:35:00", "doctitle": "省领导在三明市现场督导中央生态环保督察典型案例通报问题整改工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2159564, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231224_1987467.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1986383, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231221_1986383.htm", "content": "\n　　12月20日，市委书记李兴湖、市长李春到三元区，结合开展第二批主题教育，深入一线调研耕地保护和粮食安全工作。市领导杨兴忠、杨国昕参加。\n　　李兴湖一行深入市荆西粮食和物资储备公司、福建振贤粮油公司、市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231221_1986383.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.21 09:02:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研耕地保护和粮食安全工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2159572, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231221_1986383.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/", "rels": []}]}